#: src/features/Review/ReviewDashboard.tsx:52
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Hi. My name is Alex. I'm the creator of FluencyPal. If you've used "
"FluencyPal, I'd appreciate your honest review on Trustpilot. Your feedback "
"helps me improve the product and helps other learners understand what to "
"expect. Please share your real-life experiences, whether positive, "
"negative, or mixed."
msgstr ""
"Hai. Nama saya Alex. Saya pencipta FluencyPal. Jika anda telah menggunakan "
"FluencyPal, saya hargai ulasan jujur anda di Trustpilot. Maklum balas anda "
